The factors to be considered on an application to extend the time to restore an appeal mirror the factors for restoring the appeal — there is no requirement that two separate applications be filed. Clark v. Alberta (Institute of Chartered Accountants, Complaints Inquiry Committee), [2015] A.J. No. 935, 2015 ABCA 271 at para. 6 (Alta. C.A.); , [2016] A.J. No. Settlement Lenders Inc. v. Blicharz 121, 2016 ABCA 33 at para. 12 (Alta. C.A.).
